a=1\")\n\nThe fix splits the raw_path into path and query components, adds the trailing\nslash only to the path portion, then recombines them.\n\nFixes #3614","timestamp":"2026-03-10T13:08:36Z","author":{"name":"Varun Chawla","email":"varun_6april@hotmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"Varun Chawla","email":"varun_6april@hotmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":179492861,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNzk0OTI4NjE=","name":"httpx","full_name":"encode/httpx","private":false,"owner":{"login":"encode","id":19159390,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE5MTU5Mzkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19159390?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode","html_url":"https://github.com/encode","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/encode/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/encode/httpx","description":"A next generation HTTP client for Python. 🦋","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/forks","keys_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/keys{/key_id}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/collaborators{/collaborator}","teams_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/teams","hooks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/hooks","issue_events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/encode/httpx/issues/events{/num